abstract: "Evidence base compiled to support the UCLA One IT Research Working Group (2026).
  Covers RDWG findings (2021-2024), peer benchmarking at 25 R1 libraries, risk patterns
  from peer institution IT consolidations, UC policy analysis, and faculty testimony
  from 33 leadership meetings and 4 public forums."
